Best workaround for you: disable automatic compaction
Your global config currently is:
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json"
}
change it to

{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "compaction": {
    "auto": false
  }
}
run :notepad "$env:USERPROFILE\.config\opencode\opencode.jsonc"

